   "result_text": "# Model: `monthly_rev`\n\n- **data_source:** `bench`\n- **row_count:** 35\n\n## Backing Query\n\n**1. final**\n- source_model: `orders`\n- time_dimensions: order_date\n- measures: rev\n\n## Backing Query SQL\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n  _stage_inner.\"orders.order_date\" AS \"order_date\",\n  _stage_inner.\"orders.rev\" AS \"rev\"\nFROM (\n  SELECT\n    DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', orders.order_date) AS \"orders.order_date\",\n    CAST(SUM(orders.amount) AS DOUBLE) AS \"orders.rev\"\n  FROM orders AS orders\n  GROUP BY\n    DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', orders.order_date)\n) AS _stage_inner\n```\n\n## Columns (2)\n\n| name | type | unique | sql | allowed_aggregations | sampled |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| order_date | TIMESTAMP | yes | order_date | all | 2023-01-01 00:00:00 .. 2025-12-01 00:00:00 |\n| rev | DOUBLE | — | rev | all | 7270.0 .. 11804.920000000002 |\n\n## Measures (0)\n\n_(none)_\n\n## Joins (0)\n\n_(none)_\n\n## Data Profile SQL\n\n```sql\nWITH monthly_rev AS (\n  SELECT\n    _stage_inner.\"orders.order_date\" AS \"order_date\",\n    _stage_inner.\"orders.rev\" AS \"rev\"\n  FROM (\n    SELECT\n      DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', orders.order_date) AS \"orders.order_date\",\n      CAST(SUM(orders.amount) AS DOUBLE) AS \"orders.rev\"\n    FROM orders AS orders\n    GROUP BY\n      DATE_TRUNC('MONTH', orders.order_date)\n  ) AS _stage_inner\n)\nSELECT\n  COUNT(*) AS \"monthly_rev._count\",\n  COUNT(DISTINCT monthly_rev.order_date) AS \"monthly_rev.order_date_count_distinct\",\n  CAST(AVG(monthly_rev.rev) AS DOUBLE) AS \"monthly_rev.rev_avg\"\nFROM monthly_rev AS monthly_rev\nLIMIT 20\n```\n\n## Data Profile\n\n| _count | order_date_count_distinct | rev_avg |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 35 | 35 | 9505.384285714286 |",
